        "reignFields": [
          {
            "field": "reign",
            "office": "Emperor of Eastern Wu",
            "raw": "3 September 264 – 1 May 280{{efn|Sun Hao's biography in the ''Sanguozhi'' recorded that Sun Hao surrendered on the ''renshen'' day of the 3rd month of the 4th year of the ''Tianji'' era of his reign.<ref>([天紀四年三月]壬申，王濬最先到，於是受皓之降，解縛焚櫬，延請相見。) ''Sanguozhi'' vol. 48.</ref> This is an error as there was no ''renshen'' day in that month. The ''Zizhi Tongjian'' recorded that it was the ''renyin'' day of the 3rd month of the 1st year of the ''Taikang'' era of Sima Yan's reign.{{sfnp|Sima|1084|loc=vol. 81}} This date corresponds to 1 May 280 in the Gregorian calendar. Emperor Wu's biography in ''Book of Jin'' gave the same date as the one recorded in Sun Hao's biography in ''Sanguozhi''. However, Wang Jun's biography recorded a [[memorial to the throne]] in which he wrote that he reached Moling on the 15th day of that month.<ref>(臣以十五日至秣陵) ''Jin Shu'', vol.42</ref> The 15th day of the 3rd month of that year was a ''renyin'' day.}}",
            "parsed": null,
